{"parse": {"title": "AR-4", "pageid": 89274, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/AR-3\" title=\"AR-3\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">AR-4</span><a href=\"/wiki/AR-5\" title=\"AR-5\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">AR</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">4</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E8.B0.9C.E9.A2.98.E6.B7.B1.E5.A4.84\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"谜题深处\">谜题深处</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 谜题深处</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Behind the Puzzle</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>这些游戏对你有帮助吗，苏菲亚？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>苏菲亚刚刚从游戏场上下来，37便迫不及待地凑了过来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>它们是否有趣？是充满灵感的，还是乏味干瘪的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>是应该被记录的，还是该被弃置在实验室角落的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>唔，我承认它们并没有我想的那么无聊，把推演过程表示出来也很易懂……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>对于一个刚刚来到小岛的孩子而言，这是很好的游戏。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>如果我在小时候就玩到它，也许我会更喜欢数学——更早地领略到“万物皆数”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>但对于现在的我来说，它派不上什么用场，也谈不上什么启发。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>唔……是这样啊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>我们已经体验过了……可还是没有任何所得，究竟是哪里不对呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>笔记本在37的手中被失望地来回翻动，她似乎又陷入了思考。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>天已经黑了，人们也三三两两地离开了沙滩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但37的游戏仍未有所收获。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>对她的助手而言，这或许才是合乎情理的结果——这个游戏除了简单的启蒙和教学，并没有什么深刻的“寓意”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>唔唔唔——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>去吃晚餐吧，向6申请的沙滩使用时间已经结束了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>不，再等等……！只要我不去吃晚餐，就还没有结束……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>37念念不舍地看着沙滩上的格子线，好像脚在上面生根了一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这些数字的谜题一定会整夜整夜地在她脑子里盘旋，取代掉所有的烤兔肉和蜂蜜面包片。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>即使谁都能看出来这组数列并没有什么“深意”——但万一那是人们看得还不够深呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>……明天早上我还有空闲，也许我们可以那时候来做尝试。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>从阿波罗星初升的清晨开始，也许能有新的思绪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>……？！真的吗？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>不然你应该会在这里待一整晚吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>苏菲亚叹了口气，被迫面对自己又一次纵容了37的事实。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>我不明白，37。你为什么断定这组答案构成的数列里会有尚未解明的深意呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>嗯？因为它就在那里啊！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>虽然很模糊，但我感受到了，休在写下这些数字时，带着强烈的感情……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>……所以，你依靠的是直觉吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>直觉……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>谈到这个词时，女孩脸上的表情黯淡了下去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在岛外，在她曾被称为“神秘学家”的童年时刻，她对这个词并不陌生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>感受，聆听，洞悉，祈求，全身心专注，捕捉那灵感的一闪。这些她很熟悉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但她也并不能随时随地直接看到灵光，并像扑捉指间蝴蝶一样和它们嬉戏。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这样的能力……究竟又意味着什么呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>苏菲亚——快跟上来！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>再不去食堂的话，就只能喝锅底的底料汤了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>37已经动作灵活地跃过面前的一排海鸥脚印，在前方回身向苏菲亚招手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>等等我，马上来！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>是的，不要忘记，并非每道题目都需要答案。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>现在还有更需要做的事。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "AR-4"}}